🔸Cancelation:
🔹Suppose the same image is requested by 3 callers:
Caller A ──┐
Caller B ──┼──→ profile.jpg → ONE shared download
Caller C ──┘
Scenario 1: A cancels
A ❌
B ✅
C ✅
🔹We decrement:
callers = 2  Do NOT cancel the download, because B and C still need the image.
🔹flow:
request -> completed/cancel -> caller --   -> check if caller = 0 -->  request.deferred.cancel()


🔸Deduplication
Problem: Multiple callers request the same URL.
🔹Without deduplication:
A → Network ──→ profile.jpg
B → Network ──→ profile.jpg
C → Network ──→ profile.jpg
📌Goal: Stop unnecessary work. so use inFlightRequest


